  - Table: Content
    Key: content.item.u837f1488.description
    Zh: "\u53EF\u4F5C\u4E3A\u8C37\u7269\u6EE1\u8DB3\u5C45\u6C11\u996E\u98DF\u9700\u6C42\uFF0C\u4E5F\u53EF\u7528\u4E8E\u519C\u7530\u64AD\u79CD\u3002"
    En: Counts as grain for residents' dietary needs and can also be sown on farms.
  - Table: Content
    Key: content.item.ub169f99c.description
    Zh: "\u53EF\u4F5C\u4E3A\u852C\u83DC\u6EE1\u8DB3\u5C45\u6C11\u996E\u98DF\u9700\u6C42\u3002"
    En: Counts as a vegetable for residents' dietary needs.
  - Table: Content
    Key: content.item.u3460dd6d.description
    Zh: "\u53EF\u4F5C\u4E3A\u852C\u83DC\u6EE1\u8DB3\u5C45\u6C11\u996E\u98DF\u9700\u6C42\u3002"
    En: Counts as a vegetable for residents' dietary needs.
  - Table: Content
    Key: content.item_group.food_vegetable.name
    Zh: "\u852C\u83DC"
    En: Vegetables
  - Table: Content
    Key: content.item_group.food_grain.name
    Zh: "\u8C37\u7269"
    En: Grain
  - Table: Content
    Key: content.item_group.food.name
    Zh: "\u98DF\u7269"
    En: Food
  - Table: Content
    Key: content.item_group.food_vegetable.description
    Zh: "\u80E1\u841D\u535C\u3001\u767D\u83DC\u7B49\u852C\u83DC\u7269\u54C1\uFF0C\u53EF\u66FF\u4EE3\u6EE1\u8DB3\u5C45\u6C11\u7684\u852C\u83DC\u9700\u6C42\u3002"
    En: Vegetables such as carrots and cabbage can satisfy residents' vegetable needs
      interchangeably.
  - Table: Content
    Key: content.item_group.food_grain.description
    Zh: "\u5C0F\u9EA6\u7B49\u8C37\u7269\u7269\u54C1\uFF0C\u53EF\u4F5C\u4E3A\u5C45\u6C11\u98DF\u7269\u4E0E\u519C\u7530\u79CD\u5B50\u3002"
    En: Grains such as wheat can feed residents and serve as farm seed.
  - Table: Content
    Key: content.item_group.food.description
    Zh: "\u6240\u6709\u53EF\u98DF\u7528\u7269\u54C1\u7684\u7236\u7EA7\u5206\u7C7B\uFF0C\u7528\u4E8E\u51BB\u5E93\u7B49\u901A\u7528\u98DF\u7269\u89C4\u5219\u3002"
    En: Parent category for all edible items, used by general food rules such as
      cold storage.
